t","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t1-r014-c05"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》曆月欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"八月","scope":"received_calendar_month_attestation","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t1-r014-c01"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》年首承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"二年十月","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t1-r004-c01"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》數位公元年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"208","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t1-r004-c00"}],"rationale":"本傳授王／徙王事件與月表同人同事對讀，只換算公元年。原曆月及在位月序分列，不把月序當曆月，不以死亡補爵位終年；未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"田榮乃立田儋子市為齊王","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","reference_event_quote":"楚救榮，得解歸，逐田假，立儋子市為齊王，始。","reference_year_quote":"208","reference_year_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007"},"record_id":"th-shiji094-008","person_id":"u87_cc1_7vm_A","endpoint":"start","title":"齊王"},{"era":"BCE","era_year":206,"year":-205,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"項羽既存趙，降章邯等，西屠咸陽，滅秦而立侯王也，乃徙齊王田市更王膠東，治即墨。齊將田都從共救趙，因入關，故立都為齊王，治臨淄。故齊王建孫田安，項羽方渡河救趙，田安下濟北數城，引兵降項羽，項羽立田安為濟北王，治博陽。田榮以負項梁不肯出兵助楚、趙攻秦，故不得王；趙將陳餘亦失職，不得王：二人俱怨項王。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan","source_id":"s-shiji-094-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/094.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》授王／徙王事件","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"二十。王田市始，故齊王。","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t2-r002-c10"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》曆月欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"二月。漢王始，故沛公。","scope":"received_calendar_month_attestation","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t2-r002-c11"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》年首承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"一。義帝元年。諸侯尊懷王為義帝。","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t2-r001-c01"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》數位公元年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"206","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t2-r001-c00"},{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》膠東欄起點","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","quote":"分為膠東。","scope":"received_table_column_scope","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-016-t2-r001-c10"}],"rationale":"本傳授王／徙王事件與月表同人同事對讀，只換算公元年。原曆月及在位月序分列，不把月序當曆月，不以死亡補爵位終年；未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"乃徙齊王田市更王膠東","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007","reference_event_quote":"二十。王田市始，故齊王。","reference_year_quote":"206","reference_year_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷016&oldid=2607007"},"record_id":"th-shiji094-008","person_id":"u87_cc1_7vm_A","endpoint":"end","title":"齊王"},{"era":"BCE","era_year":206,"year":-205,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"項羽既存趙，降章邯等，西屠咸陽，滅秦而立侯王也，乃徙齊王田市更王膠東，治即墨。齊將田都從共救趙，因入關，故立都為齊王，治臨淄。故齊王建孫田安，項羽方渡河救趙，田安下濟北數城，引兵降項羽，項羽立田安為濟北王，治博陽。田榮以負項梁不肯出兵助楚、趙攻秦，故不得王；趙將陳餘亦失職，不得王：二人俱怨項王。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan","source_id":"s-shiji-094-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/094.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記・秦楚之際月表》授王／徙王事件","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?tit